<sp><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Dubois.</hi></speaker> <p>Und was fehlt Ihnen denn?</p></sp><lb/>
<sp><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Dorante.</hi></speaker> <p>Ich bin verdru&#x0364;ßlich, a&#x0364;rgerlich;<lb/>
