<sp><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Dubois.</hi></speaker> <p>Und wer i&#x017F;t denn die&#x017F;er Tyrann,<lb/>
die&#x017F;er Henker?</p></sp><lb/>
<sp><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Dorante.</hi></speaker> <p>Meine Frau.</p></sp><lb/>
<sp><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Dubois.</hi></speaker> <p>Ihre Frau, mein Herr?</p></sp><lb/>
